# Day 9 — NutriScope: AI-Powered Nutrition Tracker

## 🥗 What I Built

**NutriScope** — a complete, single-file HTML nutrition tracking application built entirely with Claude in Cowork mode. No backend, no framework, no install. Just open in a browser and track.

Built in two iterations:
- **MVP (v1.0)** — Core nutrition tracker with 20 foods and 10 nutrients
- **Enhanced (v2.0)** — Full-featured app with 60 foods, 16 nutrients, meal planner, risk analysis, and more

