## 🚀 Features

### MVP (v1.0)
- **Profile inputs** — Age, gender, height, weight, activity level, dietary preference
- **Food database** — 20 common Indian foods (Rice, Roti, Dal, Paneer, Egg, Chicken, Fish, etc.)
- **10 nutrients tracked** — Calories, Protein, Carbs, Fat, Fiber, Iron, Calcium, Vit C, Vit D, Vit B12
- **Food log** — Add, edit quantity, remove entries
- **Dashboard** — Energy progress, macro doughnut chart, micronutrient radar, deficiency/excess lists
- **Recommendations** — Personalised food adds, swaps, portion adjustments by diet type
- **Dark premium UI** — Chart.js, mobile responsive, no backend

### Enhanced (v2.0)
- **60-food database** — Added nuts, seeds, vegetables, fruits, spices, oils, seafood
- **16 nutrients** — Added Sodium, Potassium, Magnesium, Zinc, Omega-3, Folate
- **CSV Upload** — Import food log from spreadsheet
- **Quick food search** — Type-to-search across all 60 foods
- **4 dietary modes** — Vegetarian, Eggetarian, Non-Vegetarian, Vegan (auto-filters foods)
- **Health goal setting** — Maintain / Lose (−500 kcal) / Gain (+300 kcal)
- **Health conditions** — Diabetes, Hypertension, Anaemia, Osteoporosis-specific flags
- **2-Day Meal Planner** — Manual + Auto-Fill + CSV Export
- **Risk Analysis tab** — 7 risk categories with HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW severity
- **4 charts** — Doughnut, Radar, Bar (Day 1 vs Day 2 trend), Meal calorie breakdown
- **Micronutrient deep dive** — Absorption tips per nutrient (Vit C + Iron pairing, etc.)
- **Sources & Methodology** — IFCT 2017, ICMR 2020, USDA, Mifflin-St Jeor citations
- **Educational disclaimer** — Not medical advice, clearly stated

